onk62/", "num_games_owned": 212, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 669, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 324, "last_played": 1639013554, "avatar": "9db4379c2531f5accd95570c7ac358f7169393dc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Probably the best rogue-like I've played and SUPER fun with friends. Definitely get this one", "timestamp_created": 1606067321, "timestamp_updated": 1606067321, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79669994", "author": {"steamid": "76561198126307409", "personaname": "Your boi Daryll", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/babydaryll/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 1208, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 937, "last_played": 1661601305, "avatar": "d3eb39d70f297a4191bea908797cd7972a77ad86"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dude this game is awesome, it's made by a single dev who lives in Hong Kong. The game in its current state is amazing. Just some translation and minor grammatical errors. Feels finished, just needs light polishing work. However, this game is far too cheap for its current state. I would have paid $25 for this title. By far, this is one of the best early access titles I've purchased. It's a toss up between this and Rimworld.\n\nAnyways, much love DEV!\n\n", "timestamp_created": 1606065541, "timestamp_updated": 1606065541, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79669859", "author": {"steamid": "76561198012152463", "personaname": "Anton Chigurh", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198012152463/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 215, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 95, "last_played": 1606097261, "avatar": "dda89b118b7a888d77d25f56b6b1bf9280ddf17c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game, but needs more variety, especially classes.  Also putting a level lock on the classes was a bad decision imo.  Game has alot of potential.", "timestamp_created": 1606065361, "timestamp_updated": 1606065361, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79659177", "author": {"steamid": "76561199004454856", "personaname": "cathedr_l", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199004454856/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 7949, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2728, "last_played": 1760587142, "avatar": "cbe6ecb20136c65e8953e7f57008be77e4b4bf14"}, "language": "english", "review": "Amazing game. The wide variety of weapons, inscriptions (weapon stat boosts/bonuses), and hopefully soon more characters to play, make this game a really fun fps. It's  also a rogue-lite, so I feel like, even though I technically am grinding for permanent upgrades, the game doesn't feel grindy. I would highly recommend this game for anyone who likes fast-paced fps games, or rogue-lites/likes.", "timestamp_created": 1606051393, "timestamp_updated": 1606051393, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79653618", "author": {"steamid": "76561197963410322", "personaname": "Kamuflaro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197963410322/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 61, "playtime_forever": 2232, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1533, "last_played": 1607771763, "avatar": "39148b81df3b6013cac3d09b303b6f2dcbc7c5d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's fun bit it could be better. Howwever with a 10€ price tag on it I cannot complain. 1 hour is enough to evaluate whether it's fun or not. If you don't like it, just refund it.", "timestamp_created": 1606042994, "timestamp_updated": 1606042994, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79646271", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018523800", "personaname": "Synveil", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018523800/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 4878, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2576, "last_played": 1711708529, "avatar": "95d8f1c00bbdc43e289e494f3dad027a6f930ac4"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is one of those gems that stands out once in a while, especially for its pricepoint.\nThe gunplay is extremely well dialled in and feels good, the variation in weapons is great and the fact these are random helps keep each play through fresh. \nThere are builds that are optimal but you can't rely on getting those, so dealing with what you get keeps the game interesting. It is reminiscent of my old days raiding in MMO's where learning a bosses abilities and patterns really comes through and shows as you get that little bit closer to killing a boss each time you reach it. \n\nIf I have one solid complaint about the game it's the puzzle vaults with boulders, they are the bane of my existence, Luckily I had a partner who was far better at it than me who ressed me every time my dumb ass ran in front of doubles. \n\n11/10 (extra point cos you slap lizards to reload them)", "timestamp_created": 1606029672, "timestamp_updated": 1606388429, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79646018", "author": {"steamid": "76561198104430373", "personaname": "Twistry!", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198104430373/", "num_games_owned": 289, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4689, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2469, "last_played": 1711708529, "avatar": "d22bc10451606f723d8da08ddabdb4a27c5accbd"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awesome game that held our attention pretty well for the last few weeks which is pretty hard to do haha. Its like Risk of Rain with each round you start from scratch and build your way up but it doesn't feel as punishing when you do die and have to restart. once you get the hang of things you tend to fly through the first stages and get back to the newer stuff pretty quickly. Gun play itself is very smooth and everything just feels good about the game. 9/10, I would give it a 10 except you slap the lizard to reload its ammo!! Poor lizard did not deserve a slap! :')", "timestamp_created": 1606029114, "timestamp_updated": 1606029114, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}]}